cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software (below) and the paper listed under preferred-citation."
title: "CheckFungalContam: A browser-based fungal contamination checker for spacecraft and space-health applications"
abstract: >-
  A single-page, browser-based tool for predicting fungal contaminants relevant
  to spacecraft and space health. It matches a user-supplied species list against
  1,553 curated fungi, each scored on six contamination-relevant properties
  (antimicrobial resistance, biofilm formation, human pathogenicity, thermophily,
  radiation resistance, and spore formation), and flags likely contaminants with
  interactive charts. The tool runs entirely client-side; no data leaves the
  browser.
